{title: Tujhse Door Jo Hota Hoon}
{artist: Gajendra Verma}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
Teri [E] aankhon ke sahaare,        Main [B] khwaab dekhun saare
Ab [C#m] lamha lamha guzre,        Teri [A] palkon ke kinare
[E] Pehle tha main tanha,        Main [B] tha awara lamha
Ab [C#m] tham gayi tujh mein duniya meri,        [A] Tham gaye nazare
[E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon,        [B] Tukda tukda sota hoon
[C#m] Ankhon mein bhi rota hoo main [A] raate,        [E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon
[B] Khud ko jaise khota hoon,        [C#m] Hoton pe sanjota hoon teri [A] baatein
[E] [B] [C#m] [A],        [E] Tujh mein hi ab saans chalegi
[B] Tujh mein hi dhadkan dhadkegi,        [C#m] Tu hi ab to pass rahegi
[A] pass rahegi dil ke,        [E] Raatein na hogi tere bin
[B] Honge na ab mere ye din,        [C#m] Waqt chalega mera tujh ko [A] milke
[E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon,        [B] Tukda tukda sota hoon
[C#m] Ankhon me bhi rota hoon main [A] raate,        [E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon
[B] Khud ko jaise khota hoon,        [C#m] Hoton pe sanjota hoon teri [A] baatein
Aaja baija gallan kariye,        Dil ju aapne pyaar pariye
Deja leja ye raatein deja,        Aaja baija gallan kariye
[E] [B] [C#m] [A],        [E] [B] [C#m] [A]
[E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon,        [B] Tukda tukda sota hoon
[C#m] Ankho me bhi rota hun main [A] raate,        [E] Tujhse door jo hota hoon
